WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:38.780 --> 01:41.990
The Heart of Knights

01:46.260 --> 01:47.470
Keep it steady...

01:48.700 --> 01:50.270
Keep it steady... All right.

01:49.920 --> 01:51.090
Let's PNP! Aim for PPP!

01:51.480 --> 01:52.540
Stop.

01:52.540 --> 01:53.590
Isn't it good?

01:53.820 --> 01:56.720
Yes, it's progressing well.

01:56.870 --> 02:00.500
Yes, everyone is working so hard.

02:00.500 --> 02:03.970
After all, this is a once-a-year festival.

02:04.210 --> 02:08.980
But isn't there a better time to hold this festival?

02:09.480 --> 02:10.980
What do you mean?

02:11.210 --> 02:14.170
The Knight Selection Exam is just around the corner.

02:14.170 --> 02:17.280
The students shouldn't spend their time playing around.

02:17.370 --> 02:19.560
These are two different matters.

02:19.560 --> 02:21.500
If exams are the student's duty,

02:21.500 --> 02:26.290
then the festival... No, the PNP part of a student's duty as well?

02:26.420 --> 02:28.540
No, definitely not. Full stop.

02:28.720 --> 02:30.270
PNP?

02:30.270 --> 02:31.000
Yeah.

02:32.070 --> 02:36.550
Prism Night Party, in short PNP.

02:36.830 --> 02:44.560
Marquis, are you forgetting that Tempelritter Commander Judas will be attending this year's exam?

02:44.900 --> 02:46.180
Of course not!

02:46.500 --> 02:49.290
A change in the atmosphere is essential for learning.

02:49.290 --> 02:53.840
Those who can't handle both the festival and learning are only half-rated knights.

02:53.840 --> 02:55.230
Isn't that right?

02:55.420 --> 02:59.990
Marquis, by any chance, was it really you
that wanted to enjoy this festival?

03:01.080 --> 03:02.710
B-By the way, Karin,

03:02.710 --> 03:05.620
would you like to open a Japanese-style maid café?

03:06.040 --> 03:07.410
Wearing a cute outfit...

03:07.410 --> 03:09.530
Welcome!

03:09.530 --> 03:12.540
If you were to dress up as a maid, customers would love it.

03:14.340 --> 03:15.630
I refuse.

03:15.750 --> 03:17.340
Ah. I see.

03:24.340 --> 03:26.640
I said it's nothing.

03:26.730 --> 03:28.140
Not again...

03:30.380 --> 03:34.270
You keep everything inside.
We're all men, open up and speak freely.

03:34.270 --> 03:38.610
It hurts, stop it. My injuries haven't fully recovered yet.

03:38.850 --> 03:40.490
From what Acty says,

03:40.490 --> 03:43.870
you spent the night with the princess in an indecent place...

03:44.220 --> 03:46.310
You didn't come back until the next morning.

03:46.310 --> 03:47.540
The next morning?!

03:49.440 --> 03:50.970
So how's the progress?

03:50.970 --> 03:55.020
Tell Onii-san, in detail.

03:55.020 --> 03:56.790
Priecia and me?

03:59.820 --> 04:01.720
Kiss, have you kissed?

04:01.950 --> 04:03.430
It's not like that.

04:03.430 --> 04:06.470
There's no way we would kiss or anything like that.

04:17.460 --> 04:18.780
What happened?

04:19.430 --> 04:20.120
Nothing.

04:26.690 --> 04:29.800
<i>There's no way we would kiss or anything like that.</i>

04:30.800 --> 04:33.230
<i>What did he mean by kiss or "anything like that"?</i>

04:37.140 --> 04:37.880
<i>Kiss...</i>

04:40.180 --> 04:43.090
There you are, Priecia.

04:43.180 --> 04:45.840
I'd like to ask you something.

04:45.940 --> 04:50.080
I'm currently writing a drama script for PNP.

04:50.080 --> 04:52.890
It's about the vast love between a prince and a princess.

04:52.970 --> 04:54.940
It's a masterpiece full of laughter and tears.

04:54.940 --> 04:58.150
Ah... Even I'm touched with tears. It's sure to make you cry.

04:58.360 --> 05:01.850
But the princess seems to be lacking some realism.

05:01.850 --> 05:04.110
So I'd like to hear your commen...

05:06.480 --> 05:08.160
She's gone.

05:09.150 --> 05:11.850
<i>What am I doing?</i>

05:15.010 --> 05:20.630
The courage to face my weakness without running away... eh?

05:24.550 --> 05:27.430
All right, let's begin the afternoon lesson.

05:27.950 --> 05:30.970
Open your textbook to page 160.

05:31.690 --> 05:35.440
The Prism teachings will finally be entering the final chapters.

05:35.590 --> 05:38.690
Although it might be difficult, everyone do you best!

05:40.010 --> 05:44.320
Swordsmen as well, it will be a big mistake if you think that magic is unrelated to you.

05:44.470 --> 05:46.180
If you don't study properly,

05:46.180 --> 05:49.370
getting hit by magic is going to hurt.

05:49.970 --> 05:53.090
Are you listening, Hyaweh?!

05:54.170 --> 05:55.380
Hyaweh.

05:56.730 --> 05:58.290
Even though you're in class,

05:58.380 --> 06:00.110
don't let your guard down.

06:00.110 --> 06:01.690
Prism Bomber!

06:08.390 --> 06:11.640
This is so pitiful.

06:11.810 --> 06:15.520
New wounds appear before the old ones can heal. This is troublesome. Troublesome.

06:17.070 --> 06:20.770
Be serious. PNP is right around the corner.

06:20.770 --> 06:23.650
Hyaweh, are you aiming for the PPP as well?

06:24.060 --> 06:25.650
PPP?

06:25.740 --> 06:28.280
What? Don't you know about PPP?

06:28.380 --> 06:30.370
Perfect Polity Pelican?

06:31.000 --> 06:34.290
or is it Pink Panties Penguin?

06:34.500 --> 06:38.790
From the words, Prism Night's Prince and Princess.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.580
A male student will be chosen as the prince.

06:40.580 --> 06:43.460
A female student will be chosen as the princess.

06:44.440 --> 06:46.000
Oh, it's "Princess".

06:47.010 --> 06:50.220
It's such a headache for someone like me to get it mixed up. A headache.

06:50.310 --> 06:52.120
What are you talking about, Bridget?

06:52.120 --> 06:54.350
Listen, PPP is...

06:54.820 --> 06:59.890
The most outstanding male and female in Rosenberg Knights' Academy.

07:07.170 --> 07:08.850
They're huge...

07:10.960 --> 07:18.080
To get selected for PPP, your knowledge, manners and strength must be topnotch.

07:20.340 --> 07:21.690
Lady Priecia.

07:23.680 --> 07:26.050
You have... something on your mind?

07:27.390 --> 07:29.800
It's nothing for you to worry about, Kagura.

07:30.850 --> 07:31.800
Okay.

07:31.890 --> 07:34.300
In other words, PPP is proof of an elite.

07:34.390 --> 07:36.030
You'll get top class salary as a knight...

07:36.030 --> 07:38.090
and it'll be a convenience when looking for a job.

07:39.550 --> 07:41.310
Are you listening, Orichi?

07:41.440 --> 07:45.510
Which means this is our final chance to be chosen as knights.

07:46.700 --> 07:49.820
But it would be impossible for us to get chosen.

07:50.100 --> 07:52.410
We don't have the knowledge or the strength.

07:52.510 --> 07:53.820
That's not true.

07:54.520 --> 07:57.000
The method of selection is different every year.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.620
Last year was a triathlon.

07:58.620 --> 08:00.320
The year before was a food fight,

08:00.320 --> 08:02.660
and before that was a swimsuit competition.

08:02.660 --> 08:06.100
That's why due to the different selection tests, we have a chance to win as well.

08:06.100 --> 08:08.090
If it's a food fight, leave it to me.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.200
That's because you eat a lot.

08:10.840 --> 08:14.350
Additionally, last year's prize was a
one year supply of food vouchers.

08:14.350 --> 08:15.970
And it was Special Lunch.

08:17.840 --> 08:20.770
Special... Lunch...

08:20.940 --> 08:26.020
According to rumors, those who are
chosen as PPP will get married.

08:30.570 --> 08:32.570
Is that... true?

08:33.040 --> 08:36.440
I may have heard that rumor before... Or maybe not...

08:37.230 --> 08:43.080
Then, if Hyaweh and I were to
get selected as PPP in the PNP,

08:43.080 --> 08:46.330
it might be the fate of the PPP for us to get married.

08:47.810 --> 08:52.090
Interesting. Isn't PPP interesting?

08:52.200 --> 08:53.290
Orichi?

08:56.820 --> 09:00.850
I'll put my life on the line to win the PPP!

09:12.710 --> 09:15.860
Hey, quit slacking off.

09:15.950 --> 09:16.910
Oh, sorry.

09:21.000 --> 09:27.880
You're worrying about whether Priecia is mad at you, right?

09:27.980 --> 09:31.280
No, I've always felt that she gets angry easily...

09:31.280 --> 09:34.090
and everyone says that it's my fault.

09:34.090 --> 09:39.040
So I was wondering if you knew why.

09:42.950 --> 09:45.400
Don't worry about it so much.

09:45.400 --> 09:48.030
She's always angry.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.400
Ah... That's right.

09:49.590 --> 09:53.330
But, somehow it feels different.

09:53.330 --> 09:56.200
Although it is the same serious look, that serious look is...

09:56.290 --> 09:59.820
Girls put on a serious look for only one reason.

09:59.820 --> 10:01.950
Don't you understand?

10:02.390 --> 10:03.150
Reason?

10:05.760 --> 10:08.630
Filia should aim to be the princess as well.

10:08.630 --> 10:10.460
And the prince will be Onii-chan.

10:10.880 --> 10:12.280
W-W-Wait...

10:13.830 --> 10:18.510
The two siblings being the PPP will so cool, right? Right?

10:18.660 --> 10:20.230
Huh, Onii-chan?

10:45.690 --> 10:47.580
Shine, my Prism!

10:48.600 --> 10:50.050
Will it work?

10:57.170 --> 10:59.190
It's not working well I guess.

10:59.800 --> 11:00.180
Ouch.

11:03.650 --> 11:04.430
Priecia.

11:07.670 --> 11:09.980
What are you doing out so late?

11:10.390 --> 11:11.470
What about you?

11:12.790 --> 11:15.410
Extra training for the Knight's Selection Exam.

11:15.410 --> 11:16.480
You, too?

11:16.660 --> 11:18.270
I...

11:18.270 --> 11:23.340
I guess so. You want to get first place
and be chosen as a Royal Knight.

11:23.340 --> 11:24.490
I have something to say to you.

11:24.590 --> 11:25.410
Yes.

11:25.410 --> 11:27.020
It's about before...

11:27.020 --> 11:28.500
Before?

11:28.590 --> 11:30.590
Just shut up and listen.

11:30.590 --> 11:33.120
Before, I...

11:35.890 --> 11:38.130
If it's hard to say it, you don't have rush.

11:38.570 --> 11:39.890
I'll wait for you.

11:40.730 --> 11:42.390
What? It's not like it has nothing to do with you.

11:45.100 --> 11:46.680
I... just...

11:46.970 --> 11:48.760
Are you feeling ill?

11:48.760 --> 11:49.810
Don't come near me.

11:51.960 --> 11:52.560
Sor-

11:52.560 --> 11:53.310
Sorry.

11:54.870 --> 11:57.010
I don't know what I did,

11:57.010 --> 11:59.070
but if I've done something to make you angry, I'm sorry.

11:59.070 --> 12:00.070
I'm really sorry.

12:03.780 --> 12:06.340
All right. Let's make up by shaking hands.

12:08.210 --> 12:10.770
How can you apologize so easily?

12:10.770 --> 12:13.500
Are your words that cheap?

12:14.350 --> 12:15.000
Sorry.

12:16.010 --> 12:17.140
You said it again!

12:17.820 --> 12:21.510
In the end, our fates will end up like this.

12:21.850 --> 12:23.980
Since the first day we met.

12:25.120 --> 12:26.090
Priecia.

12:27.100 --> 12:30.770
Draw your sword. We'll decide the victor today.

12:33.410 --> 12:36.230
Hold on.

12:37.490 --> 12:38.240
Who's there?

12:37.490 --> 12:38.240
Who are you?

12:38.930 --> 12:43.360
Crossing swords in the middle of the night has it's perks.

12:43.560 --> 12:44.880
Marquis.

12:44.880 --> 12:47.030
Don't you dare interfere this time.

12:47.630 --> 12:50.700
I was wondering what a young male and female would be doing together in the forest at night...

12:50.700 --> 12:52.530
I didn't expect it to be a duel.

12:52.530 --> 12:55.470
This is not very elegant.

12:55.470 --> 12:58.130
Young people, like you, should be doing secret dating.

12:58.490 --> 12:59.960
What rubbish are you saying?

12:59.960 --> 13:02.130
Marquis, what are you doing here?

13:02.270 --> 13:04.090
Eh? Me?

13:04.090 --> 13:06.470
I'm patrolling — night patrol.

13:06.470 --> 13:10.520
Some cute students often use the night as an opportunity to do some immoral thi—

13:10.520 --> 13:14.440
No, no, no. They are not allowed to do such a thing. That's why I'm patrolling.

13:16.170 --> 13:19.440
Anyways, a duel before the graduation is not good.

13:20.720 --> 13:23.220
If you have to decide on a victor no matter what,

13:23.220 --> 13:24.950
why not use other methods?

13:25.760 --> 13:28.200
No, I don't really want to have a duel.

13:28.650 --> 13:30.700
I have a good idea.

13:31.950 --> 13:36.500
Important notice: This year's PPP selection method will be...

13:36.590 --> 13:38.380
an acting contest!

13:40.450 --> 13:45.340
And the male and female leads will be this year's honorable PPP.

13:46.160 --> 13:48.280
Why acting?

13:48.280 --> 13:49.640
That's a good question.

13:50.340 --> 13:53.790
From a beautiful, peaceful palace to a bloody battlefield,

13:53.790 --> 13:56.660
a knight needs to know how to face these different situations...

13:56.660 --> 13:58.520
and the ability to act is very important.

13:58.670 --> 14:01.190
Acting won't help decide a victor.

14:01.670 --> 14:04.320
The main characters are a prince and a princess.

14:04.320 --> 14:09.140
The victor will be the one who is able
to get the role and act it perfectly.

14:09.140 --> 14:10.160
How's that?

14:10.510 --> 14:12.160
I have nothing else to discuss with you.

14:12.460 --> 14:16.100
Since when would I do such an outdated method?

14:16.100 --> 14:17.790
Then, how?

14:17.880 --> 14:20.990
Director, come here!

14:25.170 --> 14:26.220
Hello.

14:26.310 --> 14:27.120
Fel?

14:27.120 --> 14:28.470
Director?

14:28.560 --> 14:30.450
I want to be an actress.

14:30.450 --> 14:33.380
Actually, I'm more suitable for ambitious art.

14:33.380 --> 14:36.230
So you can leave everything regarding the stage to me.

14:37.900 --> 14:40.030
Being an actress is every girl's dream.

14:40.030 --> 14:42.580
Every girl dreams of being Cinderella.

14:42.580 --> 14:47.030
So, the method of selection will be using a Cinderella method.

14:47.150 --> 14:48.370
Cinderella...

14:48.370 --> 14:49.530
...method?

14:53.780 --> 14:56.980
This is a necessity for a knight, Breast Armor.

14:57.610 --> 14:59.540
Look at its magnificent shape.

15:00.060 --> 15:01.520
And what about it?

15:02.170 --> 15:03.880
Tomorrow's bell will be the starting signal.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.390
Wearing this armor,

15:05.390 --> 15:10.120
The fastest pair on the stage to do the pose will be chosen as the main lead. Yes.

15:11.840 --> 15:13.240
I don't have time for this.

15:15.310 --> 15:16.530
Are you running away?

15:18.650 --> 15:22.080
This display can be considered as a knight's ideal.

15:22.080 --> 15:26.070
Can one who does not have any ideals be a good knight?

15:27.060 --> 15:30.070
Looks like this match is over for Priecia,
who lost without fighting.

15:32.200 --> 15:34.770
That's sly. There are two lead roles.

15:34.770 --> 15:39.370
If both of us were to win, it would be impossible to decide who the victor is.

15:39.570 --> 15:42.640
You have to get the lead role before you begin the true duel.

15:42.640 --> 15:47.130
I will make a fair judgment to decide who's acting is better.

15:47.370 --> 15:51.450
But, that is only if both of you can get the lead roles.

15:53.440 --> 15:55.760
Entry is open to all students in the school.

15:55.760 --> 15:58.000
This competition will be a fierce one.

15:58.000 --> 16:01.940
It's possible that others might become the PPP.

16:02.090 --> 16:02.960
That...

16:04.770 --> 16:08.520
You decide to have a duel because of a coincidence.

16:08.520 --> 16:11.090
This time, use your own strength to win the entry.

16:11.090 --> 16:15.620
And settle it once and for all in public.

16:18.050 --> 16:21.960
Don't you think this is a good chance
to let coincidence become fate?

16:22.450 --> 16:24.460
Let coincidence become fate.

16:24.740 --> 16:27.060
Now, let me explain the play.

16:27.060 --> 16:28.100
First, the title.

16:29.130 --> 16:30.010
Note: It's a pun on Sleeping Beauty, Snow White and Cinderella.

16:29.130 --> 16:30.010
Sleeping

16:29.130 --> 16:30.010
Snow

16:29.130 --> 16:30.010
Cinderella

16:29.130 --> 16:30.010
White

16:30.370 --> 16:32.710
The Sleeping Beauty -- Snow...

16:32.710 --> 16:34.260
Tsundere?

16:32.750 --> 16:36.760
TL Note：Tsundere and Cinderella have similar writing and pronunciation.

16:34.350 --> 16:36.760
No, no. It's Cinderella.

16:36.930 --> 16:38.210
I'm going back.

16:38.890 --> 16:39.740
Wait, wait!

16:39.740 --> 16:42.310
Listen to the story, it's very touching.

16:43.250 --> 16:45.320
Fel's first production.

16:45.320 --> 16:48.050
A production that is certain to bring all of Windland to tears.

16:48.050 --> 16:51.860
<i>The Sleeping Beauty -- Snow Cinderella White,</i> will now begin.

16:53.800 --> 16:54.780
Once upon a time,

16:54.870 --> 16:58.480
there was a very beautiful princess whose name was Snow Cinderella White.

16:58.480 --> 17:01.530
The princess fell in love the neighboring country's prince. But...

17:02.690 --> 17:05.040
I'm always not frank,

17:07.010 --> 17:08.540
Yo, Cinderella.

17:08.540 --> 17:10.050
You are such a beauty.

17:10.250 --> 17:11.440
Ah, I'm so happy.

17:11.440 --> 17:14.380
Let me kiss you right now. Kiss...

17:14.380 --> 17:17.100
You got your lines wrong, Marquis.

17:17.390 --> 17:19.600
Sorry, I got carried away.

17:22.120 --> 17:23.550
Yo, Cinderella.

17:23.550 --> 17:25.230
You are such a beauty.

17:25.400 --> 17:27.060
A beauty?

17:27.060 --> 17:30.290
I don't want to hear such undisguised flattery.

17:33.140 --> 17:35.280
That was too much, Princess.

17:36.850 --> 17:38.960
The days they met were filled with violence.

17:38.960 --> 17:41.200
She went to the prince's palace to confess her feelings,

17:41.200 --> 17:43.750
but she was mistaken as a thief and, in the end, she had to fight with him.

17:46.090 --> 17:51.180
Ah, as a tender-hearted lady, am I able to confess?

17:51.180 --> 17:53.030
No, definitely not. Full stop.

17:54.560 --> 17:57.090
I feel that this script harbors evil intentions.

17:57.500 --> 18:01.470
On the side, the awakened prince picks up the Breast Armor dropped by the princess.

18:01.640 --> 18:04.680
Oh, such a dynamite Breast Armor.

18:04.680 --> 18:06.600
This fits my ideals.

18:07.710 --> 18:10.250
Regarding the prince's character, in a good way, he is honest.

18:10.250 --> 18:12.610
To put it bluntly, he is an ass kisser.

18:12.750 --> 18:13.940
That makes sense.

18:14.560 --> 18:15.110
Eh?

18:15.960 --> 18:18.970
By the way, the princess's mother
had passed away at an early age.

18:18.970 --> 18:21.110
The current queen is her step-mother.

18:21.110 --> 18:25.120
Her step-mother is an introvert and her mirror is her only friend.

18:25.210 --> 18:27.190
Mirror, Mirror, Mirror,

18:27.190 --> 18:30.850
who's the most beautiful person in the world?

18:31.630 --> 18:33.880
That, of course, is the Queen.

18:34.110 --> 18:37.060
Just as I expected. Just to be safe, let's ask again.

18:37.060 --> 18:39.460
Who's the most beautiful person in the world?

18:39.460 --> 18:41.930
It's the Queen. Hahaha.

18:42.210 --> 18:44.330
Just as I expected, just as I expected.

18:44.330 --> 18:47.190
This same continuous questioning
becomes the Queen's daily routine.

18:47.280 --> 18:48.460
But one day,

18:50.340 --> 18:52.730
Who's the most beautiful person in the world?

18:53.510 --> 18:55.420
That would be Snow Cinderella White.

18:57.880 --> 19:00.490
What did you say? Repeat yourself.

19:00.940 --> 19:04.450
It's Snow Cinderella White, unfortunately.

19:08.120 --> 19:09.500
I'm broken!

19:12.330 --> 19:14.060
Damn that Snow Cinderella White.

19:14.060 --> 19:16.310
How dare she become more beautiful than me?!

19:16.310 --> 19:17.510
I'll bury her alive.

19:18.380 --> 19:21.440
The Queen, whose pride was hurt, asked the princess out to the forest...

19:21.440 --> 19:23.860
and ordered her henchman to kill the princess.

19:23.860 --> 19:26.790
Next, the fate of the pure but not so frank princess...

19:26.790 --> 19:30.250
and the ass kissing prince, how would their ending be?

19:30.970 --> 19:32.650
That's the end of the preview.

19:32.650 --> 19:34.270
How was it? Were you touched?

19:34.420 --> 19:35.680
Boring.

19:35.680 --> 19:36.630
Wait, wait.

19:36.630 --> 19:38.670
It gets more interesting after that.

19:38.670 --> 19:41.720
The princess, who escaped to the forest, lived happily with the people living there.

19:41.720 --> 19:45.130
But she was smashed by an apple from the Queen and knocked into a coma...

19:48.410 --> 19:49.040
And after that,

19:49.160 --> 19:52.830
when the prince hears the rumors of the princess in the forest, he appears.

19:52.830 --> 19:55.840
Fighting with monsters and getting all bloody.

19:55.930 --> 19:58.150
It was like a miracle. A miracle of love.

19:58.150 --> 20:00.400
He then helps the princess into the Breast Armor.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.890
Ah, it fits perfectly.

20:01.890 --> 20:04.700
"This princess is my soul mate." That's how the plot unfolds.

20:04.700 --> 20:05.640
Are you touched?

20:07.000 --> 20:08.350
I won't do it.

20:08.430 --> 20:12.040
You can't? In the end, the prince and princess confess their love to each other.

20:12.040 --> 20:15.360
As the finale, they will have a passionate kiss.

20:15.530 --> 20:17.860
Kiss?

20:17.950 --> 20:20.210
They finally meet after many hardships.

20:20.210 --> 20:23.210
We should get a passionate kiss.

20:23.210 --> 20:24.370
How shameless...

20:24.610 --> 20:25.730
It's not shameless.

20:26.360 --> 20:30.580
In a love scene, actors are required to have experience as well as the ability to act.

20:30.580 --> 20:36.020
Is there anything more suitable for PPP than this?

20:36.020 --> 20:37.570
No. definitely not. Full—

20:37.570 --> 20:40.880
I'll accept the challenge.

20:43.170 --> 20:46.180
We'll accept the acting competition.

20:47.170 --> 20:48.430
We?

20:48.520 --> 20:50.810
I originally wanted to settle it through sword fighting,

20:50.810 --> 20:53.940
but since My Lord has said so much, he's convinced me.

20:54.020 --> 20:55.700
I don't really...

20:56.910 --> 21:00.240
Then it's decided. Although it is acting, a duel is a duel.

21:00.240 --> 21:01.610
Bet your life on it.

21:03.360 --> 21:05.040
Then, we'll decide on the victor tomorrow.

21:06.860 --> 21:10.160
Hey, hey. You two are getting too excited.

21:10.260 --> 21:12.300
Yeah, the princess will be Filia.

21:12.300 --> 21:16.230
Then my first kiss will be on the stage with Onii-chan...

21:16.230 --> 21:18.460
Ah! That's too embarrassing.

21:19.220 --> 21:22.220
Hyaweh, your kissing partner will be me.

21:22.390 --> 21:23.450
Special...

21:23.450 --> 21:24.260
...Lunch.

21:24.920 --> 21:27.270
All right, all right. Kids should just keep quiet.

21:27.270 --> 21:30.450
This kind of thing should be left to the adults.

21:30.450 --> 21:32.230
I'm sure it will fit me well.

21:35.020 --> 21:35.980
It dropped.

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.910
Next Episode

23:16.990 --> 23:22.020
The school has finally been turned into an acting competition battlefield.

23:23.050 --> 23:26.720
Onii-chan, stop lazing around and
be serious about the competition.

23:27.860 --> 23:30.310
Next episode, The Dance of Knights.

23:30.310 --> 23:32.200
Shine, the miracle of love!

23:33.110 --> 23:37.390
The ones standing on the stage will be Filia and Onii-chan.

23:34.600 --> 23:39.060
The Dance of Knights
